evidence\": \"File formats only specify a low-level layout of stored data\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"'low-level layout' is vague and undefined, 'File formats' is unspecified, and the scope of 'only' is syntactically unclear.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"KP-029\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_condition\",\n      \"evidence\": \"File formats only specify a low-level layout of stored data\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Does not identify which file formats are referenced or define/link the stored data layout specification.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"KP-030\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_condition\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Global hot key cannot be changed\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Does not specify what the global hot key combination or triggered action is, nor what happens if a user tries to change it or if it conflicts with another shortcut.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"KP-031\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_error_handling\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Title, username or URL cannot be changed in a TAN entry.\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"States an immutability rule without specifying how attempts to modify those fields are handled (e.g., disabled UI fields vs. error message on save).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"KP-032\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_error_handling\",\n      \"evidence\": \"When a TAN is used, it expires automatically and can never be used again.\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Passive phrasing omits what actions constitute 'used' (e.g., Auto-Type, copy, view), which component enforces expiration, and what happens if a user attempts to reuse an expired TAN.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","duration_seconds":118.956108,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens"